msgid ""
"The following Cloud/Zone types have established Distributed Worker Cloud "
"API proxy and Agent relay support:"
msgstr "Les types Cloud/Zone suivants disposent d'une prise en charge établie du proxy API Cloud Worker distribué et du relais Agent :"

